#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Kursus IBM gratis tentang informasi dan komputasi kuantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we'll analyze Grover's algorithm to understand how it works.\n"
"We'll start with what could be described as a *symbolic* analysis, where we calculate how the Grover operation $G$ acts on certain states, and then we'll tie this symbolic analysis to a *geometric* picture that's helpful for visualizing how the algorithm works.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita akan menganalisis algoritma Grover untuk memahami cara kerjanya.\n"
"Kita akan mulai dengan apa yang bisa disebut sebagai analisis *simbolik*, di mana kita menghitung bagaimana operasi Grover $G$ bertindak pada keadaan tertentu, kemudian kita akan menghubungkan analisis simbolik ini dengan gambaran *geometris* yang membantu untuk memvisualisasikan cara kerja algoritma.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solutions and non-solutions {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"
msgstr "Solusi dan bukan-solusi {#solutions-and-non-solutions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start by defining two sets of strings.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita mulai dengan mendefinisikan dua himpunan string.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  A_0 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 0\\bigr\\} \\\\\n"
"  A_1 &= \\bigl\\{ x\\in\\Sigma^n : f(x) = 1\\bigr\\}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The set $A_1$ contains all of the solutions to our search problem while $A_0$ contains the strings that aren't solutions (which we can refer to as *non-solutions* when it's convenient).\n"
"These two sets satisfy $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ and $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n$, which is to say that this is a *bipartition* of $\\Sigma^n$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Himpunan $A_1$ berisi semua solusi untuk masalah pencarian kita sementara $A_0$ berisi string yang bukan solusi (yang bisa kita sebut sebagai *bukan-solusi* bila perlu).\n"
"Kedua himpunan ini memenuhi $A_0 \\cap A_1 = \\varnothing$ dan $A_0 \\cup A_1 = \\Sigma^n$, yang artinya ini adalah *bipartisi* dari $\\Sigma^n$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next we'll define two unit vectors representing uniform superpositions over the sets of solutions and non-solutions.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya kita akan mendefinisikan dua vektor satuan yang mewakili superposisi seragam atas himpunan solusi dan bukan-solusi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert A_0\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_0} \\vert x\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  \\vert A_1\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert}} \\sum_{x\\in A_1} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Formally speaking, each of these vectors is only defined when its corresponding set is nonempty, but hereafter we're going to focus on the case that neither $A_0$ nor $A_1$ is empty.\n"
"The cases that $A_0 = \\varnothing$ and $A_1 = \\varnothing$ are easily handled separately, and we'll do that later.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara formal, setiap vektor ini hanya didefinisikan ketika himpunan yang bersesuaian tidak kosong, tetapi mulai sekarang kita akan fokus pada kasus di mana $A_0$ maupun $A_1$ tidak kosong.\n"
"Kasus di mana $A_0 = \\varnothing$ dan $A_1 = \\varnothing$ mudah ditangani secara terpisah, dan kita akan melakukannya nanti.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an aside, the notation being used here is common: any time we have a finite and nonempty set $S$, we can write $\\vert S\\rangle$ to denote the quantum state vector that's uniform over the elements of $S$.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai catatan tambahan, notasi yang digunakan di sini umum: setiap kali kita memiliki himpunan $S$ yang hingga dan tidak kosong, kita dapat menulis $\\vert S\\rangle$ untuk menyatakan vektor keadaan kuantum yang seragam atas elemen-elemen $S$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's also define $\\vert u \\rangle$ to be a *uniform* quantum state over all $n$-bit strings:\n"
msgstr "Mari kita juga mendefinisikan $\\vert u \\rangle$ sebagai keadaan kuantum *seragam* atas semua string $n$-bit:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{N}} \\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n} \\vert x\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice that\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We also have that $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle$, so $\\vert u\\rangle$ represents the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ after the initialization in step 1 of Grover's algorithm.\n"
msgstr "Kita juga punya bahwa $\\vert u\\rangle = H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle$, sehingga $\\vert u\\rangle$ mewakili keadaan register $\\mathsf{Q}$ setelah inisialisasi pada langkah 1 algoritma Grover.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that just before the iterations of $G$ happen in step 2, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ is contained in the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, and moreover the coefficients of these vectors are real numbers.\n"
"As we will see, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ will always have these properties — meaning that the state is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — after any number of iterations of the operation $G$ in step 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini berarti tepat sebelum iterasi $G$ terjadi pada langkah 2, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ terkandung dalam ruang vektor dua-dimensi yang dibentangkan oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, dan selain itu koefisien vektor-vektor ini adalah bilangan nyata.\n"
"Seperti yang akan kita lihat, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ akan selalu memiliki sifat-sifat ini — artinya keadaan adalah kombinasi linear nyata dari $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ — setelah sejumlah iterasi operasi $G$ pada langkah 2.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "An observation about the Grover operation {#an-observation-about-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Observasi tentang operasi Grover {#an-observation-about-the-grover-operation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We'll now turn our attention to the Grover operation\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita akan beralih perhatian ke operasi Grover\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G = H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} Z_f,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "beginning with an interesting observation about it.\n"
msgstr "dimulai dengan observasi menarik tentangnya.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine for a moment that we replaced the function $f$ by the composition of $f$ with the NOT function — or, in other words, the function we get by flipping the output bit of $f$.\n"
"We'll call this new function $g$, and we can express it using symbols in a few alternative ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bayangkan sebentar kita menggantikan fungsi $f$ dengan komposisi $f$ dengan fungsi NOT — atau dengan kata lain, fungsi yang kita dapatkan dengan membalik bit keluaran $f$.\n"
"Kita akan menyebut fungsi baru ini $g$, dan kita dapat mengekspresikannya menggunakan simbol dengan beberapa cara alternatif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(x) = \\neg f(x) = 1 \\oplus f(x) = 1 - f(x) =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & f(x) = 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & f(x) = 1\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(-1)^{g(x)} = (-1)^{1 \\oplus f(x)} = - (-1)^{f(x)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, and therefore\n"
msgstr "untuk setiap string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, dan oleh karena itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_g = - Z_f.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This means that if we were to substitute the function $f$ with the function $g$, Grover's algorithm wouldn't function any differently — because the states we obtain from the algorithm in the two cases are necessarily equivalent up to a global phase.\n"
msgstr "Ini berarti jika kita menggantikan fungsi $f$ dengan fungsi $g$, algoritma Grover tidak akan berfungsi secara berbeda — karena keadaan yang kita peroleh dari algoritma dalam dua kasus tersebut pasti setara sampai fase global.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This isn't a problem!\n"
"Intuitively speaking, the algorithm doesn't care which strings are solutions and which are non-solutions — it only needs to be able to *distinguish* solutions and non-solutions to operate correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bukan masalah!\n"
"Secara intuitif, algoritma tidak peduli string mana yang merupakan solusi dan mana yang bukan — ia hanya perlu mampu *membedakan* solusi dan bukan-solusi agar bekerja dengan benar.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action of the Grover operation {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"
msgstr "Aksi operasi Grover {#action-of-the-grover-operation}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now let's consider the action of $G$ on the quantum state vectors $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang mari kita pertimbangkan aksi $G$ pada vektor keadaan kuantum $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, let's observe that the operation $Z_f$ has a very simple action on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, mari kita amati bahwa operasi $Z_f$ memiliki aksi yang sangat sederhana pada $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Second, we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"The operation $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is defined as\n"
msgstr ""
"Kedua, kita memiliki operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"Operasi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ didefinisikan sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} \\vert x\\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\vert x\\rangle & x = 0^n \\\\[2mm]\n"
"-\\vert x\\rangle & x \\neq 0^n,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "again for every string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, and a convenient alternative way to express this operation is like this:\n"
msgstr "lagi untuk setiap string $x\\in\\Sigma^n$, dan cara alternatif yang nyaman untuk mengekspresikan operasi ini adalah seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} = 2 \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A simple way to verify that this expression agrees with the definition of $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ is to evaluate its action on standard basis states.\n"
msgstr "Cara sederhana untuk memverifikasi bahwa ekspresi ini sesuai dengan definisi $Z_{\\mathrm{OR}}$ adalah dengan mengevaluasi aksinya pada keadaan basis standar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ can therefore be written like this:\n"
msgstr "Operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$ oleh karena itu dapat ditulis seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 H^{\\otimes n} \\vert 0^n \\rangle \\langle 0^n \\vert H^{\\otimes n} - \\mathbb{I} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "using the same notation, $\\vert u \\rangle$, that we used above for the uniform superposition over all $n$-bit strings.\n"
msgstr "menggunakan notasi yang sama, $\\vert u \\rangle,$ yang kita gunakan di atas untuk superposisi seragam atas semua string $n$-bit.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we have what we need to compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"First let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_0\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan sekarang kita memiliki apa yang kita butuhkan untuk menghitung aksi $G$ pada $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"Pertama mari kita hitung aksi $G$ pada $\\vert A_0\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle -\\vert A_0 \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"  -\\vert A_0 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\biggl( \\frac{2\\vert A_0\\vert}{N} - 1\\biggr) \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "And second, let's compute the action of $G$ on $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Dan kedua, mari kita hitung aksi $G$ pada $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\bigl( 2 \\vert u\\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I} \\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert u\\rangle + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - 2 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"      + \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\\biggr) + \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\biggl( 1 - \\frac{2\\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\biggr) \\vert A_1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In both cases we're using the equation\n"
msgstr "Dalam kedua kasus kita menggunakan persamaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "along with the expressions\n"
msgstr "bersama dengan ekspresi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_0\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n"
"\\langle u \\vert A_1\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1 \\vert}{N}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "that follow.\n"
msgstr "yang mengikutinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In summary, we have\n"
msgstr "Singkatnya, kita memiliki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  G \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  G \\vert A_1 \\rangle\n"
"  & = - \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\vert A_0 \\rangle\n"
"      + \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} \\vert A_1 \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we already noted, the state of $\\mathsf{Q}$ just prior to step 2 is contained in the two-dimensional space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, and we have just established that $G$ maps any vector in this space to another vector in the same space.\n"
"This means that, for the sake of the analysis, we can focus our attention exclusively on this subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang sudah kita catat, keadaan $\\mathsf{Q}$ tepat sebelum langkah 2 terkandung dalam ruang dua-dimensi yang dibentangkan oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, dan kita baru saja membuktikan bahwa $G$ memetakan setiap vektor dalam ruang ini ke vektor lain dalam ruang yang sama.\n"
"Ini berarti, untuk keperluan analisis, kita dapat memusatkan perhatian sepenuhnya pada subruang ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To better understand what's happening within this two-dimensional space, let's express the action of $G$ on this space as a matrix,\n"
msgstr "Untuk lebih memahami apa yang terjadi dalam ruang dua-dimensi ini, mari kita ekspresikan aksi $G$ pada ruang ini sebagai matriks,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"whose first and second rows/columns correspond to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$, respectively.\n"
"So far in this series, we've always connected the rows and columns of matrices with the classical states of a system, but matrices can also be used to describe the actions of linear mappings on different bases like we have here.\n"
msgstr ""
"yang baris dan kolomnya pertama dan kedua masing-masing bersesuaian dengan $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"Sejauh ini dalam seri ini, kita selalu menghubungkan baris dan kolom matriks dengan keadaan klasik suatu sistem, tetapi matriks juga bisa digunakan untuk mendeskripsikan aksi pemetaan linear pada basis yang berbeda seperti yang kita miliki di sini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "While it isn't at all obvious at first glance, the matrix $M$ is what we obtain by *squaring* a simpler-looking matrix.\n"
msgstr "Meskipun tidak terlihat jelas pada pandangan pertama, matriks $M$ adalah yang kita peroleh dengan *mengkuadratkan* matriks yang tampak lebih sederhana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N} & -\\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_1\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_0\\vert}}{N} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{2 \\sqrt{\\vert A_0\\vert \\cdot \\vert A_1\\vert}}{N} & \\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert - \\vert A_1\\vert}{N}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = M\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The matrix\n"
msgstr "Matriks\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "is a *rotation matrix*, which we can alternatively express as\n"
msgstr "adalah *matriks rotasi*, yang dapat kita ekspresikan secara alternatif sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} & - \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} & \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "for\n"
msgstr "untuk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}}\\biggr).\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This angle $\\theta$ is going to play a very important role in the analysis that follows, so it's worth stressing its importance here as we see it for the first time.\n"
msgstr "Sudut $\\theta$ ini akan memainkan peran yang sangat penting dalam analisis berikut, jadi penting untuk menekankan pentingnya di sini saat kita melihatnya untuk pertama kali.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In light of this expression of this matrix, we observe that\n"
msgstr "Berdasarkan ekspresi matriks ini, kita amati bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(\\theta) & -\\sin(\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(\\theta) & \\cos(\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^2\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\cos(2\\theta) & -\\sin(2\\theta) \\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\sin(2\\theta) & \\cos(2\\theta)\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is because rotating by the angle $\\theta$ two times is equivalent to rotating by the angle $2\\theta$.\n"
"Another way to see this is to make use of the alternative expression\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini karena merotasi dengan sudut $\\theta$ dua kali setara dengan merotasi dengan sudut $2\\theta$.\n"
"Cara lain untuk melihat ini adalah dengan menggunakan ekspresi alternatif\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta\n"
"= \\cos^{-1}\\biggl(\\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}}\\biggr),\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "together with the *double angle* formulas from trigonometry:\n"
msgstr "bersama dengan rumus *sudut ganda* dari trigonometri:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"In summary, the state of the register $\\mathsf{Q}$ at the start of step 2 is\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\cos(2\\theta) & = \\cos^2(\\theta) - \\sin^2(\\theta)\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\sin(2\\theta) & = 2 \\sin(\\theta)\\cos(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
"Singkatnya, keadaan register $\\mathsf{Q}$ pada awal langkah 2 adalah\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert u\\rangle\n"
"= \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_0\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sqrt{\\frac{\\vert A_1\\vert}{N}} \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"= \\cos(\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and the effect of applying $G$ to this state is to rotate it by an angle $2\\theta$ within the space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"So, for example, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"dan efek menerapkan $G$ pada keadaan ini adalah merotasinya dengan sudut $2\\theta$ dalam ruang yang dibentangkan oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
"Jadi, misalnya, kita memiliki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"G \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(3\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(3\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^2 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(5\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(5\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\\\\[1mm]\n"
"G^3 \\vert u \\rangle &= \\cos(7\\theta) \\vert A_0\\rangle + \\sin(7\\theta) \\vert A_1\\rangle\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "and in general\n"
msgstr "dan secara umum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"G^t \\vert u \\rangle\n"
"= \\cos\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\sin\\bigl((2t + 1)\\theta\\bigr) \\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Geometric picture {#geometric-picture}"
msgstr "Gambaran geometris {#geometric-picture}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's connect the analysis we just went through to a geometric picture.\n"
"The idea is that the operation $G$ is the product of two *reflections*,\n"
"$Z_f$ and $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$.\n"
"And the net effect of performing two reflections is to perform a *rotation*.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita hubungkan analisis yang baru saja kita lakukan dengan gambaran geometris.\n"
"Idenya adalah bahwa operasi $G$ adalah hasil kali dari dua *refleksi*,\n"
"$Z_f$ dan $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}.$\n"
"Dan efek bersih dari melakukan dua refleksi adalah melakukan *rotasi*.\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's start with $Z_f$.\n"
"As we already observed previously, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita mulai dengan $Z_f$.\n"
"Seperti yang sudah kita amati sebelumnya, kita memiliki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_0\\rangle & = \\vert A_0\\rangle \\\\[1mm]\n"
"Z_f \\vert A_1\\rangle & = -\\vert A_1\\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within the two-dimensional vector space spanned by $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$,\n"
"this is a *reflection* about the line parallel to $\\vert A_0\\rangle$, which we'll call $L_1$.\n"
"Here's a figure illustrating the action of this reflection on a hypothetical unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$,\n"
"which we're assuming is a real linear combination of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam ruang vektor dua-dimensi yang dibentangkan oleh $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$,\n"
"ini adalah *refleksi* terhadap garis yang sejajar dengan $\\vert A_0\\rangle$, yang kita sebut $L_1$.\n"
"Berikut adalah gambar yang menggambarkan aksi refleksi ini pada vektor satuan hipotetis $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$,\n"
"yang kita asumsikan sebagai kombinasi linear nyata dari $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of a reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Gambar yang menggambarkan aksi refleksi pada vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection1.svg)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Second we have the operation $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$, which we've already seen can be written as\n"
msgstr "Kedua kita memiliki operasi $H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n}$, yang sudah kita lihat dapat ditulis sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H^{\\otimes n} Z_{\\mathrm{OR}} H^{\\otimes n} = 2 \\vert u \\rangle \\langle u \\vert - \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is also a reflection, this time about the line $L_2$ parallel to the vector $\\vert u\\rangle$.\n"
"Here's a figure depicting the action of this reflection on a unit vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini juga merupakan refleksi, kali ini terhadap garis $L_2$ yang sejajar dengan vektor $\\vert u\\rangle$.\n"
"Berikut adalah gambar yang menggambarkan aksi refleksi ini pada vektor satuan $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of a second reflection on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Gambar yang menggambarkan aksi refleksi kedua pada vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/reflection2.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When we compose these two reflections, we obtain a rotation — by twice the angle between the lines of reflection — as this figure illustrates.\n"
msgstr "Ketika kita mengkomposisikan dua refleksi ini, kita mendapatkan rotasi — sebesar dua kali sudut antara garis-garis refleksi — seperti yang diilustrasikan gambar ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A figure depicting the action of the Grover operation on a vector.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Gambar yang menggambarkan aksi operasi Grover pada vektor.](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/grover-algorithm/Grover_rotation.svg)\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This explains, in geometric terms, why the effect of the Grover operation is to rotate linear combinations of $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ and $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ by an angle of $2\\theta$.\n"
msgstr "Ini menjelaskan, dalam istilah geometris, mengapa efek operasi Grover adalah merotasi kombinasi linear dari $\\vert A_0\\rangle$ dan $\\vert A_1\\rangle$ dengan sudut $2\\theta$.\n"
